   "caption": "352 overtakes. Two very different verdicts. 🗣️ F1’s tally from Las Vegas tells one story. The drivers’ reactions add another. Race winner Max Verstappen compared it to Mario Kart, explaining how the slipstream and battery deployment made it difficult to escape the pack. Carlos Sainz enjoyed that tactical challenge. For him, reading rivals and choosing when to attack were part of what made the race worthwhile. Did Vegas deliver the kind of racing you want from F1?",
