   "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DgHuwH-iJyP/",
   "mediaType": "CAROUSEL_ALBUM",
   "caption": "Absolutely devastated. For the first time in my career, fighting in the top 5 with a genuine chance of a special result. To end it in the way it did, losing the car under SC, is just incredibly hard to take. No words to describe how I’m feeling right now. We work for years, our whole lives, for these moments and opportunities. In a midfield car, they come very rarely, and when they do, you need to grab them with both hands. The pain of missing out on something like this, and the endless thoughts of what could have been, will always hurt. Naturally, as the driver, you blame yourself in these mo",
